## Interface: 16001, 120000, 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100
## Title: FrogLib
## Category: Frog Wizard
## Notes: The code Frog Wizard's addons share: their options page, texture and font lists, borders, threat, hiding Blizzard's frames, fading when idle, swing timers, cast bars, the five-second rule, text templates, unit colours, names and levels, raid marks and click-to-target buttons. Each of them already carries a copy, so this only needs installing on its own if you want the newest one.
